// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Polish game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf), using the names of the
// Polish release where they exist (GLA, ALW, Centrum dowodzenia, Burza SCUD, Czarny Lotos, ...).
// Officers address the player as "generale" and "sir"; everyone uses the 2nd person singular.
// Multiplayer map names stay in English. Includes legacy labels for older game data.
// Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py. See languages/README.md before editing.

